# AutoShip environment variables. Copy to .env.local and fill in values locally.
# Never commit real values. Only variables prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ reach the browser,
# so server secrets must never use that prefix.
#
# The application shell (Milestone 1, task 1) needs no variables to run.
# Later tasks will add, for example:
#   Supabase (task 2): project URL, public anon key, server-only service-role key
#   SolvaPay (Milestone 3): server-only sandbox secret key
